 § Pallu or Phallu = "distinguished"
 the 2nd son of Reuben, father of Eliab, and progenitor of a family of Israel

H1648.d:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Gen.46.11;
 son of: Levi (H3878);
