 the prophet and lawgiver, leader of the exodus

H3324.d:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Exo.6.18;
 son of: Kohath (H6955);
 brother of: Amram (H6019), Hebron (H2275B) and Uzziel (H5816);
