H5644.d:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, only mentioned at Exo.6.22;
 son of: Uzziel (H5816);
 brother of: Mishael (H4332), Elizaphan (H0469), Micah (H4318J) and Isshiah (H3449I)
